<p>This Privacy Policy explains how {{ site.title }} ("we", "us", or "our") handles information when you visit this website.</p>

<h2>Information we collect</h2>

<p>We do not use analytics, advertising, or tracking tools on this site, and we do not record how you use it. This site has no forms and does not ask you for any personal information.</p>

<p>If you choose to email us, we receive your email address and whatever you include in your message. We use it only to respond to you.</p>

<h2>Hosting</h2>

<p>This site is hosted on <a href="https://pages.github.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub Pages<span class="visually-hidden"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>, a service of GitHub, Inc. When you visit, GitHub may collect technical information such as your IP address, browser type, and the pages you request as part of operating and securing its service. We do not have access to this information through the site. GitHub's use of it is governed by the <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub Privacy Statement<span class="visually-hidden"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>.</p>

{% if site.googleFonts != "" %}
<h2>Fonts</h2>

<p>This site loads its typeface from Google Fonts. When a page loads, your browser requests the font files from Google's servers, which receive your IP address and browser information. Google's use of this information is governed by the <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Privacy Policy<span class="visually-hidden"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>.</p>
{% endif %}

<h2>Cookies and embedded content</h2>

<p>This site does not set cookies and does not embed videos or other third-party content. Search runs in your browser and does not send what you type to us or anyone else.</p>

<h2>Links to other sites</h2>

<p>This site links to other websites, such as social media profiles. We are not responsible for their privacy practices, so please read their policies when you visit them.</p>

<h2>Your choices</h2>

<p>If you would like us to access, correct, or delete an email conversation we hold, please contact us using the information below.</p>

<h2>Children's privacy</h2>

<p>This site is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children.</p>

<h2>Changes to this policy</h2>

<p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date.</p>

